  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-sectoral integrated humanitarian response in DeZ, RD, Aleppo, Idleb - NH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is a multisector project (Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), Emergency Food Security and Vulnerable Livelihoods (EFSVL), and Protection) in all the hubs in Syria. DeZ, Rural Damascus, Aleppo, Idleb. The total BFs are Total 218,590 (Female 118,738, Male 99,852)  The locations are as follows: Deir Ez -Zor (DeZ): Al Mayadin, Mahkan, Qorieah, Ashara, Sbeikhan, Tishrine, Dweir, Gharibeh, Dablan, Muhasan, Hatla, Deir Ez -Zor Aleppo: Arada, Barqum, Berna, Hmeira, Kafr Joum Sharki, Zarbah, Zeitan Idleb: Sanjar, Ma&apos;arrat al -Numan Rural Damascus: Mqeilibeh, Artuz, Dhameer, Kisweh  the total fund is 5.937.613 (4,250,000 &#x20ac; contribution from European Commission Humanitarian Office (ECHO), 1.687.613&#x20ac; from other donor Social Development Centre (SDC).</narrative>
  </description>
